<%- include('head', { title: 'How it works | CP Global', desc: 'How CP Global works, from claiming a username to getting verified and found on Google.', page: 'info', back: '/' }) %>
<section class="sec" id="how"><div class="wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
  <h2 class="big">Three steps to being found.</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Claim your username</h3><p>Pick a handle nobody else can have. We check it live as you type.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Verify your face</h3><p>Your photo only reaches Google after it is verified as you.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Get found</h3><p>Your page is built for search, with a QR card to share it anywhere.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="sec soft" id="face"><div class="wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">Face verification</span>
  <h2 class="big">How we know it is really you.</h2>
  <div class="fvg">
    <ol class="fvl">
      <li><b>Upload your photo</b><p>A clear photo of your face. It stays hidden from Google until it is verified.</p></li>
      <li><b>Open the camera</b><p>Tap Verify and allow camera access. Nothing is recorded as video.</p></li>
      <li><b>Follow the guide</b><p>The screen tells you to move closer, step back or find better light. When you are in the right spot it says Good and takes the photo for you.</p></li>
      <li><b>Make one small move</b><p>Turn your head or smile when asked. That shows a real person is there.</p></li>
      <li><b>We review</b><p>Our team compares your selfies with your photo. You get a message in Notifications.</p></li>
      <li><b>Get your badge</b><p>A verified seal appears on your profile, and your photo can show on Google.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="fvm" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mring"><svg class="av" style="--a1:#d9f5e1;--a2:#0b6b2c"><use href="#av"/></svg></div><span class="mpill">Good! Hold still...</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card2 fvn"><h3>Your privacy</h3>
    <ul class="cl"><li class="ok1"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Your selfies are deleted as soon as we decide.</li><li class="ok1"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>We keep only the result: verified or not.</li><li class="ok1"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Changing your photo means verifying again.</li><li class="ok1"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>If it does not pass, you can try again any time.</li></ul></div>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/register">Start for free</a></p>
</div></section>

<%- include('foot') %>
